    "note": "Eidolon ladder is cumulative: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'When a Bud Readies to Bloom': the Talent's Super Break multiplier to Dance Partners now applies to all allies and Dance Partners get +40%, and a Dance Partner's attack fixes Toughness reduction at 25% of max Toughness (min 10, max 300; once per enemy) — no buff id, tracked as deviation. E2 'Fresh, Ethereal, and Beloved': enemies' All-Type RES -20% (dahl_a2, resAll -0.20, permanent) and enemy field-entry inflicts Wilt 3 turns. E3 'Pity Its Petals Thin as Mist': Ult Lv.+2 / Basic Lv.+1 (Wallow: Entombed Ash 3.0 -> 3.24). E4 'Pity Its Heart Gnawed by Worms': Talent FUA +5 instances and on use all enemies take +12% DMG for 2 turns (dahl_r4, vulnAll 0.12). E5 'Fallen, Decayed, and Despised': Skill Lv.+2 / Talent Lv.+2 (Talent FUA 0.30 -> 0.33). E6 'And Yet, Always, Deathly Beautiful': Dance Partners' Break Effect +150% (dahl_e6, be 1.5) and the Talent FUA advances the next Dance Partner action by 20%. Fixtures run one battle per eidolon rank e0..e6; each requirement pins the ranks where its effect must be present or absent."
